# Composer drag-drop staging — images copied here when the user
# drag-drops or +-attaches into a chat. Per-project ephemera, not source.
.soul/attachments/

# Local kernel hydration output — soul_hydrate.py rewrites CLAUDE.md
# each session-start with identity / USER / belief_map blocks that are
# personal to the operator. Public README.md is the published surface;
# CLAUDE.md stays on disk for local agents to read but is not tracked.
CLAUDE.md
